  "compare": [
    {
      "words": "establish, fix, settle",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "这三个词的一般含义是“使某人或某物稳定、固定下来”。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "establish"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 原来的含义是“使位置固定”，但现在常常表示“使确立，使存在”。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "It is a newly planted tree and it has not "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "established"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " yet. 这是一棵新栽的树，还没有扎下根来。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "fix"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 特别强调使某物在位置、状态或特征方面固定下来。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Her eyes were "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "fixed"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " on her plate. 她的双眼盯着盘子。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "settle"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 指使某人或某物安定下来。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "He had often dreamed of retiring in England and had planned to "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "settle"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " down in the country. 他常想在英国过退休生活，并打算在这个国家定居下来。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
